So I use the following config to get the Grok 4.20 models partially working. Unfortunately, the mult-agent model requires `/responses` OpenAi endpoint, which is hard-coded to specific providers in OpenCode.

X-ai needs a specific entry in the `CUSTOM_LOADERS` map in [provider.ts](https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/blob/aec6ca71fa544ca8b5e4997f5475abc72e6e924d/packages/opencode/src/provider/provider.ts#L154-L162) to use the multi-agent model.

```ts
xai: async () => {
  return {
    autoload: false,
    async getModel(sdk: any, modelID: string) {
      return sdk.responses(modelID)
    },
    options: {},
  }
},
```

